## The following text has been annotated for parts of speech by students at NTU Singapore as part of a class project in AY 2026-27.
## Verses are extracted from the taggedPBC. Annotations have been developed with manual approaches, with reference to existing literature and (where possible) native speakers.
## ISO 639-3: muv, Language: Muthuvan, Number of verses: 21
## References: Glosbe (Muthuvan to English Dictionary), (n.d.) https://glosbe.com/muv/en; Laratranslate, (n.d.). https://laratranslate.com/translate; Living Dictionaries (Muthuvan entries), (n.d.). https://livingdictionaries.app/muthuvan/entries; Manjusha, K.A. (2013). LIGHTS AND SHADOWS OF TRIBAL DEVELOPMENT IN KERALA: A STUDY ON THE MUTHUVAN TRIBE OF EDAMALAKKUDY TRIBAL SETTLEMENT IN IDUKKI DISTRICT, The Dawn Journal, 2(1), pp.274-283.; New Dravidian Etymological Dictionary, (n.d.). https://kolichala.com/DEDR/ ; 
## Contributor(s): Saranya Mushila <github.com/saranyamushila>

